{"id":"bdrobxk158h4brmguxpmukbuu","title":"职称答辩：成果在硬不在多","originalTitle":null,"summary":"答辩材料往往决定评委是否给予机会，而汇报则决定最终评价。评委关注的是问题的真伪、证据的强度和成果的不可替代性。过硬的成果需解决真问题、提供可检验的证据，并产生实际影响。答辩时应突出主线，用简洁明了的方式展示问题、方法和效果，并强调成果的独特价值。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=575926&do=blog&id=1561553"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-17T05:02:09.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-17T09:28:22.147Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-17T09:28:22.147Z","category":null,"tags":["论文发表"],"score":22,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"7c46ebeb-6ae3-418b-b015-76716573c4b2","title":"职称答辩评估标准从成果数量转向质量"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"7c46ebeb-6ae3-418b-b015-76716573c4b2","title":"职称答辩评估标准从成果数量转向质量"}],"topics":[{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fZ_8LkSd9Ko0","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}